# Line-ending + binary discipline.
# Scenario JSONs are future hash-pinned instruments: bytes matter.
# A CRLF-flipped digest fails exactly like a tampered file, so LF
# is enforced for everything textual. (Lesson paid for in full on
# a third-party clone whose bank digest caught the flip.)
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.jinja text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
